00:44:20.764 --> 00:44:21.924
But not from you, not from us.

00:44:23.260 --> 00:44:27.020
We carry out objective investigative journalism, not personal vendetta.

00:44:30.508 --> 00:44:30.828
killed.

00:44:31.692 --> 00:44:33.292
Patty Ashton for his king!

00:44:36.716 --> 00:44:37.716
You better knock me down, too.

00:44:40.396 --> 00:44:42.336
I also broke Patty's dream just years ago.

00:44:43.692 --> 00:44:44.752
I chose you instead of him.

00:44:46.892 --> 00:44:47.852
He died a bit then, too.

00:44:50.476 --> 00:44:51.436
Go ahead, knock me down.

00:44:54.348 --> 00:44:54.528
Go ahead.

00:45:00.380 --> 00:45:02.240
You do to me what you did to him over there.

00:45:05.820 --> 00:45:06.960
give somebody an apology.

00:45:09.884 --> 00:45:10.164
We both.

00:45:20.956 --> 00:45:21.796
Anything I want to say?

00:45:25.020 --> 00:45:25.900
I'll just say I'm sorry.

00:45:28.188 --> 00:45:28.628
Bless you.

00:45:57.516 --> 00:45:58.516
OK?

00:46:01.372 --> 00:46:02.952
Is that a professional inquirer?

00:46:05.628 --> 00:46:05.888
No.

00:46:14.748 --> 00:46:16.908
How long is it since anyone told you you're a great guy?
